% Scenario: a path with a curve, a closed subpath, and an open one,
% reversed and filled: the IR carries the reversed segments.
newpath
100 100 moveto 200 100 lineto 200 200 lineto closepath
300 300 moveto 350 400 400 400 450 300 curveto 400 250 lineto
reversepath fill
showpage
